    "description": "Are you a skilled Property Consultant looking for your next big career move? Casa Grande Ventures Solutions in Gwalior offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout Casa Grande Ventures Solutions:\nCasa Grande Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Conduct land acquisition due diligence and feasibility studies\n• Provide advisory services on property investment and market trends\n• Source and close property deals with prospective buyers and investors\n• Manage relationships with existing customers post-purchase\n• Achieve monthly and quarterly sales targets\n• Manage RERA documentation and compliance requirements\n• Build relationships with channel partners and brokers\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Ed / M.Ed from a recognized institution\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Property Management\n• Proficiency in Market Research\n• Proficiency in Financial Modeling\n• Proficiency in Sales Techniques\n• Proficiency in Contract Management\n• Proficiency in Portfolio Management\n• Proficiency in Lease Administration\n• Proficiency in Investment Analysis\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Flexible working hours\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Gwalior, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Casa Grande Ventures Solutions!",
